# Autarch Private Dispatch: Steering the Widemos Heir
DISPATCH HCP-820-003
ENCRYPTION: AUTARCH-QUANTUM-LOCK
ORIGIN: Lingane-Chancellery / Autarch-Personal
TARGET: Field-Operative-Tau
STARDATE: 820-G.E.122
PRIORITY: ULTRA-SEC
STATUS: CLASSIFIED
PAYLOAD:
  EVENT: "Biron Farrill safely guided toward Rhodia court."
  INTEL: "Hinrik's cowardice will push Farrill into the arms of the conspirators."
  DIRECTIVE: "Ensure Farrill acquires ship Remembrance without realizing Lingane arranged the fuel codes."
  DIRECTIVE: "Monitor Gillbret Hinriad for any recurrence of the Horsehead Nebula coordinates."
